---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Swatch · Porchlight">
  <h1>Swatch</h1>
  <p>
    A static color chip for palettes, token previews, and color metadata. The
    base rule renders a bordered box everywhere; the typed
    <code>attr()</code> enhancement reads <code>data-color</code> where
    supported.
  </p>

  <h2>Token fills</h2>
  <p>
    Set <code>--pl-c-swatch-color</code> to any token. These chips are
    decorative and sit next to visible labels.
  </p>
  <div class="pl-l-cluster">
    <span class="pl-l-cluster">
      <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-accent);"></span>
      <span>Accent</span>
    </span>
    <span class="pl-l-cluster">
      <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-success);"></span>
      <span>Success</span>
    </span>
    <span class="pl-l-cluster">
      <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-warning);"></span>
      <span>Warning</span>
    </span>
    <span class="pl-l-cluster">
      <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-danger);"></span>
      <span>Danger</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <h2>Sizes</h2>
  <p>Set <code>--pl-c-swatch-size</code> on the instance.</p>
  <div class="pl-l-cluster">
    <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-size: 1rem; --pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-accent);"></span>
    <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-accent);"></span>
    <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-size: 3rem; --pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-accent);"></span>
  </div>

  <h2>Typed data-color enhancement</h2>
  <p>
    Where typed <code>attr()</code> is supported, <code>data-color</code> supplies
    the fill directly. Keep the token fallback for browsers without the
    enhancement.
  </p>
  <div class="pl-l-cluster">
    <span
      class="pl-c-swatch"
      data-color="oklch(58% 0.18 260deg)"
      style="--pl-c-swatch-color: oklch(58% 0.18 260deg);"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Indigo"
    ></span>
    <span
      class="pl-c-swatch"
      data-color="oklch(56% 0.16 150deg)"
      style="--pl-c-swatch-color: oklch(56% 0.16 150deg);"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Emerald"
    ></span>
    <span
      class="pl-c-swatch"
      data-color="oklch(58% 0.2 25deg)"
      style="--pl-c-swatch-color: oklch(58% 0.2 25deg);"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Coral"
    ></span>
  </div>

  <h2>In context</h2>
  <p>Swatches pair with descriptions, property lists, and table cells.</p>
  <dl class="pl-c-description">
    <div class="pl-c-description__row">
      <dt class="pl-c-description__term">Production</dt>
      <dd class="pl-c-description__detail">
        <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-danger);"></span>
        <span class="pl-u-tabular-nums">#D14343</span>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="pl-c-description__row">
      <dt class="pl-c-description__term">Staging</dt>
      <dd class="pl-c-description__detail">
        <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-warning);"></span>
        <span class="pl-u-tabular-nums">#B7791F</span>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div class="pl-c-description__row">
      <dt class="pl-c-description__term">Healthy</dt>
      <dd class="pl-c-description__detail">
        <span class="pl-c-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="--pl-c-swatch-color: var(--pl-color-success);"></span>
        <span class="pl-u-tabular-nums">#2F855A</span>
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</BaseLayout>
